<title>UK: Nord Pas de Calais to launch 500 million FRF bond.</title>
<headline>Nord Pas de Calais to launch 500 million FRF bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Region Nord Pas de Calais will launch a 500 million French franc nine-year domestic bond, CDC-Marches said on Tuesday as lead manager, having been awarded the mandate.</p>
<p>Further details and the date of launch will announced next week. The deal will be guaranted by MBIA and rated Aaa/AAA.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
